---
import Layout from '../components/AcademicLayout.astro';
import {entries} from '../lib/data.js';
const entryData=JSON.stringify(entries).replaceAll('<','\\u003c');
---
<Layout title="写记录" active="write"><div class="page-title"><h2>写记录</h2></div><div class="writer"><div id="draft-banner" class="draft-banner" hidden><span>有一份本机草稿。</span><button id="resume-draft">继续编辑</button><button id="discard-draft">清除草稿</button></div><div id="review-form" class="question-review" hidden><h3>更新问题的理解</h3><blockquote id="review-question"></blockquote><form id="question-form"><label>当前状态<select name="status"><option value="review">待回顾</option><option value="open">仍在探索</option><option value="resolved">已澄清</option></select></label><label>后来的理解<textarea name="answer" rows="7" maxlength="30000" placeholder="保留原问题，在这里补充现在的理解或仍然不确定的地方。"></textarea></label><label>回顾日期<input type="date" name="resolvedAt"/></label><div class="form-actions"><button class="primary" type="submit">准备更新</button><a class="button secondary" href="/questions/">返回 Questions</a></div><p id="review-error" class="form-error" role="alert"></p></form></div><div id="existing-entry" hidden><p>编辑已有记录：</p><div class="editor-shortcuts"><a id="existing-github" target="_blank" rel="noopener">在 GitHub 编辑原记录</a><button class="text-button" id="download-existing">下载记录文件</button><a href="/write/">写一份新记录</a></div></div><form id="entry-form"><div class="form-columns"><label>标题<input name="title" required maxlength="160" value="日常学习记录"/></label><label>日期<input name="date" type="date" required/></label></div><label>随记<textarea name="reflection" rows="4" maxlength="30000" placeholder="今天的思考或收获，可以留空。"></textarea></label><h3>Knowledge</h3><p class="hint">每行一项：领域 | 短标题 | 说明。多个要点可用顿号分隔。</p><label><span class="sr-only">知识点</span><textarea name="knowledge" rows="5" placeholder="软件测试 | Oracle | 生成输入与判断对错，是两个独立的问题。&#10;软件测试 | Shrinking | 逐步缩小失败输入，让反例更容易理解。"></textarea></label><h3>Resources</h3><p class="hint">只填写确实看过或读过的资料。</p><div id="resource-fields"></div><button class="secondary" type="button" id="add-resource">添加资料</button><h3>Questions</h3><p class="hint">每行一个问题：领域 | 当时的问题。尽量保留原话。</p><label><span class="sr-only">问题原话</span><textarea name="questions" rows="5" placeholder="软件测试 | 为什么还需要 UNRESOLVED？&#10;机器学习 | 协方差矩阵到底是怎么想出来的？"></textarea></label><div class="form-actions"><button class="primary" type="submit">准备提交到 GitHub</button><button class="secondary" type="button" id="save-draft">保存本机草稿</button></div><p class="form-help">在 GitHub 提交后自动更新。草稿只保存在当前浏览器。</p><p id="form-error" class="form-error" role="alert"></p></form><section id="publish-panel" class="publish-panel" hidden tabindex="-1"><h3>提交记录</h3><p id="publish-help"></p><div class="form-actions"><button class="secondary" id="copy-entry">复制记录内容</button><button class="secondary" id="download-entry">下载记录文件</button><a id="submit-entry" class="button" target="_blank" rel="noopener">去 GitHub 提交</a></div><p>在 GitHub 点击 Commit changes 后，网站会自动发布。</p><p id="publish-message" class="status-message" role="status"></p></section></div><script id="entry-data" type="application/json" set:html={entryData}/></Layout>
